# Large or layered binary art goes through Git LFS. Requires `git lfs install` before adding any of these.
# PNGs are plain git (D6, amended 2026-11-08): sprites and screenshots are small, and judges
# cloning without LFS would otherwise get pointer files instead of images.
*.gif      filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.webp     filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.aseprite filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.psd      filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.png      binary
